
### Missing name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "09120000000"
}

### Missing number
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salman"
}

### Duplicate name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arto Hellas",
  "number": "09120000000"
}

### Empty name
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "number": "09120000000"
}
